---
// ElectronicWarfare.astro - Feature 6: EW & Radar Cross Section Spectrum Analyzer
---
<div class="hud-panel hud-corner ew-card">
  <div class="ew-header">
    <div>
      <div class="ew-title-row">
        <span class="badge badge-pantone-2022">SPECTRUM DOMINANCE</span>
        <h3 class="font-mono ew-heading">ELECTRONIC WARFARE (EW) & RADAR CROSS SECTION (RCS) ANALYZER</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="font-mono text-muted" style="font-size: 0.76rem;">Comparative stealth signatures ($m^2$), radar frequency band propagation & burn-through physics.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="physics-rule font-mono">
      <span class="rule-label">4TH ROOT RADAR EQUATION:</span>
      <span class="rule-formula" style="color: var(--primary);">R_detect ∝ ⁴√(RCS × P_t × G²)</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ew-grid">
    <!-- RCS Visual Comparison Scale -->
    <div class="rcs-scale-box hud-panel">
      <div class="scale-head font-mono">
        <span class="badge badge-pantone-2021">RCS BENCHMARKS</span>
        <span style="font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-dim);">RADAR CROSS SECTION IN SQUARE METERS (m²)</span>
      </div>

      <div class="rcs-items-list font-mono" id="rcsList">
        <!-- Item 1: B-21 / F-22 -->
        <div class="rcs-row" data-rcs="0.0001">
          <div class="rcs-target-info">
            <span class="rcs-name">B-21 Raider / F-22 Raptor</span>
            <span class="rcs-analogy font-sans text-muted">Bumblebee / Steel BB (0.0001 m²)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rcs-bar-container">
            <div class="rcs-bar" style="width: 2%; background: #6667AB;"></div>
          </div>
          <span class="rcs-val" style="color: #6667AB;">-40 dBsm</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 2: F-35 -->
        <div class="rcs-row" data-rcs="0.001">
          <div class="rcs-target-info">
            <span class="rcs-name">F-35A Lightning II</span>
            <span class="rcs-analogy font-sans text-muted">Golf Ball / Metal Marble (0.001 m²)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rcs-bar-container">
            <div class="rcs-bar" style="width: 6%; background: #8E8FC9;"></div>
          </div>
          <span class="rcs-val" style="color: #8E8FC9;">-30 dBsm</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 3: J-20A -->
        <div class="rcs-row" data-rcs="0.02">
          <div class="rcs-target-info">
            <span class="rcs-name">Chengdu J-20A Mighty Dragon</span>
            <span class="rcs-analogy font-sans text-muted">Small Bird / Sparrow (0.02 m²)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rcs-bar-container">
            <div class="rcs-bar" style="width: 14%; background: #BB2649;"></div>
          </div>
          <span class="rcs-val" style="color: #BB2649;">-17 dBsm</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 4: Su-57 -->
        <div class="rcs-row" data-rcs="0.25">
          <div class="rcs-target-info">
            <span class="rcs-name">Sukhoi Su-57 Felon</span>
            <span class="rcs-analogy font-sans text-muted">Large Eagle / Beachball (0.25 m²)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rcs-bar-container">
            <div class="rcs-bar" style="width: 28%; background: #FFBE98;"></div>
          </div>
          <span class="rcs-val" style="color: #FFBE98;">-6 dBsm</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 5: F-15 / Su-30 (Non-Stealth 4th Gen) -->
        <div class="rcs-row" data-rcs="10.0">
          <div class="rcs-target-info">
            <span class="rcs-name">F-15C Eagle / Su-30MKI</span>
            <span class="rcs-analogy font-sans text-muted">Standard 4th Gen (5.0 - 15.0 m²)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rcs-bar-container">
            <div class="rcs-bar" style="width: 75%; background: #F5DF4D;"></div>
          </div>
          <span class="rcs-val" style="color: #F5DF4D;">+10 dBsm</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Item 6: B-52 -->
        <div class="rcs-row" data-rcs="100.0">
          <div class="rcs-target-info">
            <span class="rcs-name">B-52H Stratofortress</span>
            <span class="rcs-analogy font-sans text-muted">Flying Barn Door (100.0 m²)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rcs-bar-container">
            <div class="rcs-bar" style="width: 100%; background: #A47864;"></div>
          </div>
          <span class="rcs-val" style="color: #A47864;">+20 dBsm</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Frequency Spectrum & Burn-through Calculator -->
    <div class="frequency-box hud-panel">
      <div class="freq-head font-mono">
        <span class="badge badge-pantone-2023">RADAR FREQUENCY BANDS</span>
        <span style="font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-dim);">COUNTER-STEALTH VS FIRE-CONTROL PROPAGATION</span>
      </div>

      <div class="freq-bands-grid font-mono">
        <div class="band-card">
          <div class="band-top">
            <span class="band-name" style="color: #BB2649;">VHF / UHF (Meter Waves)</span>
            <span class="band-freq">100 MHz - 1 GHz</span>
          </div>
          <p class="band-desc">Resonates with aircraft physical dimensions (wings, vertical stabilizers). Detects stealth fighters at long range, but lacks resolution to guide a missile.</p>
          <span class="band-role">ROLE: Nebo-M Early Warning Counter-Stealth</span>
        </div>

        <div class="band-card">
          <div class="band-top">
            <span class="band-name" style="color: #F5DF4D;">S-Band / L-Band</span>
            <span class="band-freq">1 GHz - 4 GHz</span>
          </div>
          <p class="band-desc">Balanced atmospheric penetration & volumetric tracking. Standard for carrier and destroyer 3D volume search.</p>
          <span class="band-role">ROLE: AN/SPY-6(V)1, Type 346B Dragon Eye</span>
        </div>

        <div class="band-card">
          <div class="band-top">
            <span class="band-name" style="color: #6667AB;">X-Band (Centimeter Waves)</span>
            <span class="band-freq">8 GHz - 12 GHz</span>
          </div>
          <p class="band-desc">Centimeter precision necessary for weapons-quality track (missile cueing). Highly degraded by RAM coatings and faceted edges of true stealth airframes.</p>
          <span class="band-role">ROLE: APG-81 (F-35 AESA), Patriot PAC-3 MPQ-65</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Creator Explainer Prompt -->
      <div class="ew-creator-hook font-mono">
        <span class="hook-label">SCRIPT INSIGHT (HOW TO EXPLAIN STEALTH TO AUDIENCES):</span>
        <p class="hook-body">
          "Stealth does NOT mean invisible to radar—it means delaying detection until the fighter is already within missile launch range. An S-400 radar that detects an F-15 at 350 km won't see an F-35 until 35 km, by which point an AMRAAM or JSM has already been fired."
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Burn-through Range Calculator -->
      <div class="burnthrough-calc hud-panel font-mono">
        <div class="calc-head">
          <span class="badge badge-pantone-2021">BURN-THROUGH CALCULATOR</span>
          <span style="font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-dim);">R = ⁴√(Pt·G²·λ²·σ / (4π)³·Smin)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="calc-controls">
          <div class="calc-row">
            <label for="ewRadar">RADAR SYSTEM:</label>
            <select id="ewRadar" class="ew-select">
              <option value="spy6" selected>AN/SPY-6(V)1 (S-Band, 30 MW)</option>
              <option value="nebo">Nebo-M (VHF, 1.2 MW)</option>
              <option value="aesa">APG-81 AESA (X-Band, 24 kW)</option>
              <option value="patriot">MPQ-65 Patriot (C-Band, 5.2 MW)</option>
              <option value="s400">91N6E S-400 (S-Band, 10 MW)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="calc-row">
            <label for="ewTarget">TARGET AIRCRAFT:</label>
            <select id="ewTarget" class="ew-select">
              <option value="0.0001">B-21 / F-22 (0.0001 m²)</option>
              <option value="0.001">F-35A (0.001 m²)</option>
              <option value="0.02">J-20A (0.02 m²)</option>
              <option value="0.25" selected>Su-57 (0.25 m²)</option>
              <option value="10">F-15C / Su-30 (10 m²)</option>
              <option value="100">B-52H (100 m²)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="calc-results">
          <div class="result-item">
            <span class="result-k">DETECTION RANGE:</span>
            <span class="result-v" id="ewDetectRange" style="color: #F5DF4D;">—</span>
          </div>
          <div class="result-item">
            <span class="result-k">WEAPONS-QUALITY TRACK:</span>
            <span class="result-v" id="ewTrackRange" style="color: #BB2649;">—</span>
          </div>
          <div class="result-item">
            <span class="result-k">MISSILE ENGAGEMENT ZONE:</span>
            <span class="result-v" id="ewMez" style="color: #FFBE98;">—</span>
          </div>
          <div class="result-item">
            <span class="result-k">STEALTH ADVANTAGE:</span>
            <span class="result-v" id="ewAdvantage" style="color: #6667AB;">—</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script is:inline>
  // Radar system base detection ranges (km) against a 1 m² RCS target
  const radarData = {
    spy6:    { name: 'AN/SPY-6', baseRange: 480, trackFactor: 0.55, mezFactor: 0.45 },
    nebo:    { name: 'Nebo-M',   baseRange: 600, trackFactor: 0.3,  mezFactor: 0.0  },
    aesa:    { name: 'APG-81',   baseRange: 180, trackFactor: 0.8,  mezFactor: 0.7  },
    patriot: { name: 'MPQ-65',   baseRange: 300, trackFactor: 0.65, mezFactor: 0.55 },
    s400:    { name: '91N6E',    baseRange: 400, trackFactor: 0.6,  mezFactor: 0.5  }
  };

  function computeEW() {
    const radarSel = document.getElementById('ewRadar');
    const targetSel = document.getElementById('ewTarget');
    if (!radarSel || !targetSel) return;

    const radar = radarData[radarSel.value];
    const rcs = parseFloat(targetSel.value);

    // Detection range: R_det = baseRange × (RCS)^(1/4)
    const detect = radar.baseRange * Math.pow(rcs, 0.25);
    const track = detect * radar.trackFactor;
    const mez = detect * radar.mezFactor;
    // Compare stealth vs non-stealth (10 m² reference)
    const refDetect = radar.baseRange * Math.pow(10, 0.25);
    const reductionPct = ((1 - detect / refDetect) * 100).toFixed(0);

    document.getElementById('ewDetectRange').innerText = detect.toFixed(0) + ' km';
    document.getElementById('ewTrackRange').innerText = track > 0 ? track.toFixed(0) + ' km' : 'N/A (VHF — no precision track)';
    document.getElementById('ewMez').innerText = mez > 0 ? mez.toFixed(0) + ' km' : 'N/A (search radar only)';

    if (rcs < 10) {
      document.getElementById('ewAdvantage').innerText = reductionPct + '% range reduction vs 4th-gen fighter';
    } else {
      document.getElementById('ewAdvantage').innerText = 'Baseline (non-stealth reference)';
    }
  }

  document.getElementById('ewRadar')?.addEventListener('change', computeEW);
  document.getElementById('ewTarget')?.addEventListener('change', computeEW);
  computeEW();
</script>

<style>
  .ew-card {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .ew-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(147, 149, 151, 0.15);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .ew-title-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .ew-heading {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .physics-rule {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-end;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }
  .rule-label {
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }
  .rule-formula {
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .ew-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1.25fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .rcs-scale-box,
  .frequency-box {
    background: rgba(14, 19, 26, 0.9);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .scale-head,
  .freq-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(147, 149, 151, 0.15);
  }

  .rcs-items-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .rcs-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1.2fr 0.6fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
  }

  .rcs-name {
    display: block;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }
  .rcs-analogy {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
  }

  .rcs-bar-container {
    height: 8px;
    background: rgba(8, 11, 15, 0.8);
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(147, 149, 151, 0.2);
  }

  .rcs-bar {
    height: 100%;
    border-radius: 3px;
    transition: width 0.3s ease;
  }

  .rcs-val {
    font-weight: 800;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .freq-bands-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .band-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(147, 149, 151, 0.12);
  }

  .band-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .band-freq {
    color: var(--text-dim);
  }

  .band-desc {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-family: sans-serif;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .band-role {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--primary);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ew-creator-hook {
    background: rgba(102, 103, 171, 0.08);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--c-pantone-2022-peri);
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .hook-label {
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    color: #8E8FC9;
    font-weight: 800;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .hook-body {
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .ew-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .burnthrough-calc {
    background: rgba(14, 19, 26, 0.9);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .calc-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(147, 149, 151, 0.15);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .calc-controls {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .calc-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 200px;
  }

  .calc-row label {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ew-select {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    color: var(--text-main);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-family: "SF Mono", Monaco, monospace;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .ew-select:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--primary);
  }

  .calc-results {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
    gap: 0.65rem;
  }

  .result-item {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid rgba(147, 149, 151, 0.15);
    padding: 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .result-k {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .result-v {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
</style>
